WEBVTT

1
00:00:19,436 --> 00:00:30,781
<i>Berakar kuat.</i>

2
00:00:31,406 --> 00:00:37,161
<i>Berakar kuat.</i>

3
00:00:37,162 --> 00:00:39,789
- Ayo, Bu. Kita hampir sampai.
- Will!

4
00:00:39,790 --> 00:00:42,500
- Ibu, itu dia.
- Kau cepat sekali. Ibu kewalahan.

5
00:00:42,501 --> 00:00:45,127
- Kau harus ikut olimpiade.
- Ayo, sudah dekat.

6
00:00:45,128 --> 00:00:48,089
Terima kasih sudah ajak aku
lihat iklan Jett.

7
00:00:48,090 --> 00:00:51,884
- Jett besar!
- Will, senyum.

8
00:00:51,885 --> 00:00:53,136
Will tiga poin.

9
00:00:54,012 --> 00:00:56,055
Jangan lakukan itu sekarang.

10
00:00:56,056 --> 00:00:58,599
Baiklah. Sudah waktunya pergi.

11
00:00:58,600 --> 00:01:01,060
Ibu harus bekerja, bukan?

12
00:01:01,061 --> 00:01:02,770
Sebentar. Putar kamera.

13
00:01:02,771 --> 00:01:04,771
Berhasil! Ini dia.

14
00:01:04,772 --> 00:01:07,024
Bagaimana kalau kau dan Ibu

15
00:01:07,025 --> 00:01:10,695
melihat pertandingan Thorn
di dalam stadion?

16
00:01:10,696 --> 00:01:12,905
Karena aku mau mengajak anakku

17
00:01:12,906 --> 00:01:17,578
menonton pertandingan roarball pertamanya!

18
00:01:18,912 --> 00:01:19,746
Apa?

19
00:01:21,874 --> 00:01:22,957
Ibu serius?

20
00:01:22,958 --> 00:01:24,960
Kecuali kalau kau sibuk.

21
00:01:25,502 --> 00:01:27,253
Sayang.

22
00:01:27,254 --> 00:01:29,255
- Tak apa-apa.
- Terima kasih.

23
00:01:29,256 --> 00:01:32,508
Terima kasih. Aku sayang Ibu.

24
00:01:32,509 --> 00:01:34,427
Ibu juga sayang kau, Will.

25
00:01:34,428 --> 00:01:36,847
- Ayo, Bu. Berakar kuat.
- Ayo!

26
00:01:37,431 --> 00:01:39,599
Ini kursinya. Di sini.

27
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:41,268
Ibu, hentikan.

28
00:01:41,852 --> 00:01:44,604
Semangat!

29
00:01:44,605 --> 00:01:46,480
<i>Selamat datang di Greenhouse!</i>

30
00:01:46,481 --> 00:01:47,733
Sudah dimulai!

31
00:01:51,195 --> 00:01:54,615
<i>Apa kau siap?</i>

32
00:01:56,491 --> 00:01:59,952
<i>- Siapa pemain terbaik?
- Siapa pemain terbaik?</i>

33
00:01:59,953 --> 00:02:02,247
<i>Siapa pemain terbaik sejati?</i>

34
00:02:12,132 --> 00:02:19,055
<i>Perkenalkan pahlawan Vineland,
lima kali menjadi pemain unggulan,</i>

35
00:02:19,056 --> 00:02:20,765
<i>Jett Fillmore.</i>

36
00:02:20,766 --> 00:02:23,226
Ya! Semangat, Vineland.

37
00:02:23,227 --> 00:02:25,604
Semangat, Jett!

38
00:02:26,897 --> 00:02:29,066
Kau bersenang-senang, Will?

39
00:02:32,694 --> 00:02:34,571
Aku akan jadi seperti dia, Ibu.

40
00:02:35,239 --> 00:02:36,406
Saat aku dewasa,

41
00:02:37,157 --> 00:02:39,284
aku akan jadi seperti dia.

42
00:02:48,836 --> 00:02:51,713
SEPULUH TAHUN KEMUDIAN...

43
00:02:55,843 --> 00:02:57,093
Satu... Ya!

44
00:02:57,094 --> 00:02:59,512
Kekuatan pikiran. Tubuhmu tak lelah.

45
00:02:59,513 --> 00:03:01,473
Kau bisa istirahat. Jangan istirahat.

46
00:03:05,435 --> 00:03:06,436
Kau pasti bisa.

47
00:03:07,771 --> 00:03:10,732
Terus berusaha.

48
00:03:13,318 --> 00:03:14,152
Aku tak apa-apa!

49
00:03:15,028 --> 00:03:16,737
Will, kau sedang olahraga?

50
00:03:16,738 --> 00:03:18,406
Hei, Theo. Benar sekali.

51
00:03:18,407 --> 00:03:20,449
Jett Fillmore tak istirahat,
aku juga tidak.

52
00:03:20,450 --> 00:03:21,534
BERMIMPI BESAR

53
00:03:21,535 --> 00:03:24,538
Kata ayahku kau tak bisa main roarball
karena terlalu kecil.

54
00:03:25,247 --> 00:03:26,998
Semua berkata itu, Theo.

55
00:03:26,999 --> 00:03:31,085
Ketika aku bermain di Thorns,
kau akan duduk di depan, Sobat.

56
00:03:31,086 --> 00:03:32,336
Ya.

57
00:03:32,337 --> 00:03:33,380
Hidup Thorns!

58
00:03:35,382 --> 00:03:36,299
KIRIMAN 10x

59
00:03:36,300 --> 00:03:37,342
Tak ada istirahat.

60
00:03:42,014 --> 00:03:43,849
Hei! Will!

61
00:03:44,349 --> 00:03:47,352
Kuharap kau tak mencoba menyelinap keluar

62
00:03:48,020 --> 00:03:50,272
tanpa membayar sewamu.

63
00:03:51,315 --> 00:03:52,565
Ya.

64
00:03:52,566 --> 00:03:56,027
Kubayar setelah kau perbaiki
lubang-lubang di plafon.

65
00:03:56,028 --> 00:03:57,945
Lubang apa?

66
00:03:57,946 --> 00:04:00,281
Harus pergi bekerja. Sampai jumpa, Frank.

67
00:04:00,282 --> 00:04:01,700
Will!

68
00:04:03,368 --> 00:04:05,119
Selamat pagi, Vineland!

69
00:04:05,120 --> 00:04:07,039
Bagi yang mengatakan itu, tolong diam.

70
00:04:10,667 --> 00:04:13,794
Berakar kuat!

71
00:04:13,795 --> 00:04:14,962
<i>Selamat datang.</i>

72
00:04:14,963 --> 00:04:17,297
<i>Malam ini, Jett Fillmore, veteran,</i>

73
00:04:17,298 --> 00:04:20,009
<i>menantang Mane Attraction, sang juara.</i>

74
00:04:20,010 --> 00:04:22,303
<i>Debat pemain terbaik di mulai.</i>

75
00:04:22,304 --> 00:04:23,971
<i>Thorns melawan Magma.</i>

76
00:04:23,972 --> 00:04:25,223
Hidup Magma!

77
00:04:25,224 --> 00:04:26,516
Hidup Shivers!

78
00:04:26,517 --> 00:04:29,352
Siapa pun yang main di Thorns.
Aku tak peduli.

79
00:04:29,353 --> 00:04:30,686
Gerald!

80
00:04:30,687 --> 00:04:34,232
Kuusir kau jika terus
mengenakan jersei tim lain.

81
00:04:34,233 --> 00:04:35,650
Carol, aku pembenci sejati.

82
00:04:35,651 --> 00:04:36,901
Kau tak dapat pai.

83
00:04:36,902 --> 00:04:38,153
Sebal. Dia ambil paiku.

84
00:04:38,820 --> 00:04:41,822
Thorns sudah sering menghancurkan hatinya.

85
00:04:41,823 --> 00:04:43,616
Ini Vineland, Gerald.

86
00:04:43,617 --> 00:04:46,244
Kita pantang menyerah. Selalu ada harapan.

87
00:04:46,245 --> 00:04:49,455
Thorns hanya perlu merekrut aku.

88
00:04:49,456 --> 00:04:51,499
Aku akan mengubah keadaan.

89
00:04:51,500 --> 00:04:53,168
Mereka merekrut kambing pengantar?

90
00:04:54,002 --> 00:04:55,753
Aku perlu pengantar makanan.

91
00:04:55,754 --> 00:04:58,673
Soal itu, Bu Carol, boleh minta naik gaji?

92
00:04:58,674 --> 00:04:59,966
Kau minta naik gaji?

93
00:04:59,967 --> 00:05:04,095
Minta Thorns untuk menang
agar para pengunjungku kembali.

94
00:05:04,096 --> 00:05:08,140
Aku ingat ketika Jett masih pemula.
Tempat ini ramai.

95
00:05:08,141 --> 00:05:10,518
Sebelum kita sadar
dia tak akan memenangkan Claw?

96
00:05:10,519 --> 00:05:12,228
Carol, boleh kembalikan painya?

97
00:05:12,229 --> 00:05:15,147
Terus bicara
dan kau tak dapat es krim juga.

98
00:05:15,148 --> 00:05:17,734
- Hati-hati dengan ini.
- Baiklah.

99
00:05:18,652 --> 00:05:20,152
Moe minta kopi lagi,

100
00:05:20,153 --> 00:05:22,321
dan pengunjung dari luar kota minta bon.

101
00:05:22,322 --> 00:05:24,949
Bagaimana caramu melakukannya?
Itu membuatku takut.

102
00:05:24,950 --> 00:05:27,244
Aku kambing. Aku melihat segalanya.

103
00:05:31,039 --> 00:05:32,456
- Oper, Will.
- Baiklah!

104
00:05:32,457 --> 00:05:34,626
- Hei, Teman-teman.
- Sampai jumpa, Will!

105
00:05:35,210 --> 00:05:37,003
<i>Thorns sudah kalah 20 poin.</i>

106
00:05:37,004 --> 00:05:38,087
Ayolah.

107
00:05:38,088 --> 00:05:39,089
Atas sini.

108
00:05:40,215 --> 00:05:41,633
Baiklah. Ayo.

109
00:05:45,971 --> 00:05:47,556
- Terima kasih.
- Sama-sama.

110
00:06:01,987 --> 00:06:03,070
ANTARKAN PESANAN!

111
00:06:03,071 --> 00:06:04,573
PESANAN BERIKUT

112
00:06:06,200 --> 00:06:07,826
Mundur. Ya!

113
00:06:08,952 --> 00:06:12,247
- Terima kasih.
- Terima kasih.

114
00:06:12,748 --> 00:06:14,583
- Silakan.
- Terima kasih.

115
00:06:19,880 --> 00:06:21,839
Sobatku. Akhirnya.

116
00:06:21,840 --> 00:06:23,883
Santai, Daryl. Kau pesan air.

117
00:06:23,884 --> 00:06:25,968
Air juga makanan, Bung.

118
00:06:25,969 --> 00:06:27,303
Hannah, Jett bagaimana?

119
00:06:27,304 --> 00:06:29,514
Mane unggul dari Jett malam ini.

120
00:06:29,515 --> 00:06:32,475
Benci kukatakan,
mungkin masa jayanya sudah berakhir.

121
00:06:32,476 --> 00:06:35,269
Serius? Jett bisa
mengatasi poni satu-trik itu.

122
00:06:35,270 --> 00:06:38,272
Apa satu-triknya adalah
menjadi terbaik dalam roarball?

123
00:06:38,273 --> 00:06:40,358
Dia mahir menembak, mengoper...

124
00:06:40,359 --> 00:06:41,692
Otot dada yang sempurna.

125
00:06:41,693 --> 00:06:43,736
Rambutnya indah.

126
00:06:43,737 --> 00:06:44,987
Mane sempurna.

127
00:06:44,988 --> 00:06:46,822
PUTAR ULANG

128
00:06:46,823 --> 00:06:48,032
<i>Astaga!</i>

129
00:06:48,033 --> 00:06:49,742
<i>- Mane Attraction kalahkan...</i>
- Di kepala!

130
00:06:49,743 --> 00:06:51,452
<i>...mantan pilihan pertama, Olivia Burke...</i>

131
00:06:51,453 --> 00:06:53,205
- Itu buruk.
<i>- ...dengan telak.</i>

132
00:06:54,039 --> 00:06:54,915
Ya ampun.

133
00:06:55,582 --> 00:06:57,166
Sudah ada memenya?

134
00:06:57,167 --> 00:06:59,460
"Kalah telak"? Kasar sekali.

135
00:06:59,461 --> 00:07:01,338
Itu tidak baik.

136
00:07:02,297 --> 00:07:04,841
Aku pergi. Aku akan berlatih di Cage.

137
00:07:04,842 --> 00:07:07,301
Apa? Tak menonton pertandingan
bersama kami?

138
00:07:07,302 --> 00:07:09,595
Aku harus latihan selagi Cage kosong,

139
00:07:09,596 --> 00:07:11,848
karena usai pertandingan,
tempatnya akan ramai.

140
00:07:11,849 --> 00:07:14,517
Jangan sampai Grizz menangkapmu.

141
00:07:14,518 --> 00:07:15,519
Tak akan.

142
00:07:16,228 --> 00:07:19,522
Berakar kuat.

143
00:07:19,523 --> 00:07:21,900
BERAKAR KUAT

144
00:07:36,874 --> 00:07:38,250
Mundur. Jett!

145
00:07:40,043 --> 00:07:42,546
Penonton bersorak riuh.

146
00:08:05,110 --> 00:08:06,111
Satu lagi.

147
00:08:07,571 --> 00:08:10,781
Hanya lima detik tersisa,
bola dioper ke Harris.

148
00:08:10,782 --> 00:08:12,241
Dia sendirian.

149
00:08:12,242 --> 00:08:14,953
Tiga, dua, satu...

150
00:08:21,126 --> 00:08:22,835
Kalian bilang apa?

151
00:08:22,836 --> 00:08:24,212
Waktunya diatur ulang?

152
00:08:24,213 --> 00:08:25,421
Jangan pertanyakan.

153
00:08:25,422 --> 00:08:27,340
Dia bisa melempar sekali lagi.

154
00:08:27,341 --> 00:08:29,843
Tiga, dua, satu...

155
00:08:38,227 --> 00:08:43,981
<i>Berakar kuat.</i>

156
00:08:43,982 --> 00:08:46,318
Suatu hari nanti.

157
00:08:53,450 --> 00:08:55,409
Suruh si lemah ini pergi.

158
00:08:55,410 --> 00:08:57,703
Apa masalahmu, Grizz?

159
00:08:57,704 --> 00:08:59,664
Tiap hari kau di sini.

160
00:08:59,665 --> 00:09:02,166
Tiap hari aku mengusirmu.

161
00:09:02,167 --> 00:09:04,126
Maksudku, apa aturannya?

162
00:09:04,127 --> 00:09:06,212
Hewan kecil tak bisa main bola.

163
00:09:06,213 --> 00:09:08,631
Pertama, aku tidak kecil. Aku medium.

164
00:09:08,632 --> 00:09:10,675
Apa? Kentang goreng medium?

165
00:09:10,676 --> 00:09:13,219
Kau tak akan bermain di Roar.

166
00:09:13,220 --> 00:09:15,263
Ayolah. Biarkan aku mencoba.

167
00:09:15,264 --> 00:09:17,223
Aku lebih baik dari kalian.

168
00:09:17,224 --> 00:09:19,017
Biar kutunjukkan kemampuanku.

169
00:09:19,560 --> 00:09:20,561
Bola.

170
00:09:21,061 --> 00:09:23,730
Kemampuanmu hanya pergi dari lapangan ini.

171
00:09:24,898 --> 00:09:26,358
Nah, pergilah.

172
00:09:26,984 --> 00:09:28,067
Terserah.

173
00:09:28,068 --> 00:09:30,445
Selamat malam, Shirley. Ini wilayahku.

174
00:09:32,114 --> 00:09:34,907
<i>Itu hasil pertandingannya.
Thorns kalah 26 poin.</i>

175
00:09:34,908 --> 00:09:36,659
Waktunya pensiun, Jett.

176
00:09:36,660 --> 00:09:39,954
Jett, bisa tanda tangan ini untukku?

177
00:09:39,955 --> 00:09:42,915
Tentu saja. Apa pun untuk penggemar.

178
00:09:42,916 --> 00:09:44,000
Ini, Nak.

179
00:09:44,001 --> 00:09:45,294
Terima kasih, Jett.

180
00:09:46,086 --> 00:09:48,088
Kenapa kau tak bisa menang kejuaraan?

181
00:09:48,672 --> 00:09:50,173
Pensiun saja!

182
00:09:50,174 --> 00:09:51,424
Jett, boleh berfoto?

183
00:09:51,425 --> 00:09:52,925
Jett, tiga kali kalah berturut.

184
00:09:52,926 --> 00:09:54,969
- Apa rasanya?
- Di mana Flo?

185
00:09:54,970 --> 00:09:56,554
- Kapan kau akan berhenti kalah?
- Flo!

186
00:09:56,555 --> 00:09:57,930
Hei. Flo?

187
00:09:57,931 --> 00:09:59,099
Ada yang melihat Flo?

188
00:10:02,853 --> 00:10:03,687
THORNS KALAH!

189
00:10:11,111 --> 00:10:12,946
Hei, Kucing Pemarah.

190
00:10:15,824 --> 00:10:17,825
Bagaimana akhir pertandingannya?

191
00:10:17,826 --> 00:10:21,538
Aku berhenti menonton
dan memukul wajahku sendiri.

192
00:10:22,080 --> 00:10:23,998
Kau pikir ini lucu?

193
00:10:23,999 --> 00:10:25,958
Kau pemilik tim ini, Flo.

194
00:10:25,959 --> 00:10:27,585
Bagaimana aku bisa menang

195
00:10:27,586 --> 00:10:30,755
kalau kau memberiku pemain sinting
dan pemain lama?

196
00:10:30,756 --> 00:10:32,340
Hei, aku sedang usahakan.

197
00:10:32,341 --> 00:10:35,259
Tak ada pemain keenam,
tetapi kau sibuk manikur.

198
00:10:35,260 --> 00:10:39,263
Dengarkan, Jett, pemain tidak gratis.

199
00:10:39,264 --> 00:10:41,849
Kecuali kau punya pemain keenam

200
00:10:41,850 --> 00:10:45,645
yang bisa bermain
dan tak minta upah besar,

201
00:10:45,646 --> 00:10:48,648
aku akan kembali mandi lumpur.

202
00:10:48,649 --> 00:10:50,274
Itu omong kosong.

203
00:10:50,275 --> 00:10:52,193
Tugasmu untuk mencarinya.

204
00:10:52,194 --> 00:10:53,653
Tukar pemain, jual tim...

205
00:10:53,654 --> 00:10:57,532
Aku tak peduli apa yang kau lakukan.
Lakukan sekarang juga.

206
00:10:57,533 --> 00:11:00,619
Hati-hati dengan keinginanmu, Jett.

207
00:11:05,958 --> 00:11:07,084
Dia tak apa-apa.

208
00:11:24,393 --> 00:11:27,395
Aku sedang mengemudi. Minggir, Medium.

209
00:11:27,396 --> 00:11:29,523
Tenanglah. Kenapa harus berteriak?

210
00:11:32,776 --> 00:11:34,819
Halo, William.

211
00:11:34,820 --> 00:11:36,737
Hei, Frank. Apa kabar?

212
00:11:36,738 --> 00:11:40,200
Kau ingin membayar sewa?

213
00:11:40,784 --> 00:11:42,910
Ya. Soal itu.

214
00:11:42,911 --> 00:11:45,246
Tenang, Frank. Aku punya uangnya.

215
00:11:45,247 --> 00:11:47,748
- Aku memang mau bayar hari ini.
- 22, 23...

216
00:11:47,749 --> 00:11:50,918
Ini bukan uang, ini selembar kertas.

217
00:11:50,919 --> 00:11:52,128
Ya.

218
00:11:52,129 --> 00:11:54,422
Sewa bulan lalu dan sebelumnya?

219
00:11:54,423 --> 00:11:57,466
Frank, ini aku. Ayolah.

220
00:11:57,467 --> 00:12:00,511
Aku butuh sedikit waktu lagi.

221
00:12:00,512 --> 00:12:02,639
Aku sudah memberimu waktu, Will.

222
00:12:03,348 --> 00:12:05,099
Aku ada tanggungan.

223
00:12:05,100 --> 00:12:06,934
Aku tak butuh satu lagi.

224
00:12:06,935 --> 00:12:09,478
- Hei, Will.
- Hei, Will.

225
00:12:09,479 --> 00:12:12,190
- Hei, Teman-Teman.
- Hei, Will.

226
00:12:12,191 --> 00:12:14,233
Hei, Will.

227
00:12:14,234 --> 00:12:15,318
Kalian masih bangun?

228
00:12:15,319 --> 00:12:17,195
- Hei, Will.
- Apa kabar, Theo?

229
00:12:17,196 --> 00:12:18,988
Mereka mengizinkanmu main di Cage?

230
00:12:18,989 --> 00:12:20,573
Kau tahu aku. Sedang berusaha.

231
00:12:20,574 --> 00:12:21,782
Banyak sekali anakmu.

232
00:12:21,783 --> 00:12:23,284
Benar.

233
00:12:23,285 --> 00:12:24,619
Maaf, Nak.

234
00:12:24,620 --> 00:12:27,496
Dengarkan, berikan uang sewaku besok

235
00:12:27,497 --> 00:12:29,957
atau kusewakan kamar itu ke hewan lain.

236
00:12:29,958 --> 00:12:31,209
Mengerti?

237
00:12:31,210 --> 00:12:33,586
- Will, aku lupa bilang...
- Nak, ayo. Masuk.

238
00:12:33,587 --> 00:12:34,588
Ayo.

239
00:12:42,721 --> 00:12:43,722
Terserah.

240
00:12:45,557 --> 00:12:46,641
<i>Butuh uang?</i>

241
00:12:46,642 --> 00:12:50,394
<i>Kau beruntung karena kau bisa
menghasilkan 300 dolar per hari.</i>

242
00:12:50,395 --> 00:12:54,775
<i>Caranya? Dengan trading kripto
di BigBroncoCrypto...</i>

243
00:12:55,275 --> 00:12:58,319
Frank, aku hamil lagi.

244
00:12:58,320 --> 00:13:01,073
Itu luar biasa, Sayang.

245
00:13:02,074 --> 00:13:05,118
Kita memang membutuhkan satu lagi.

246
00:13:05,661 --> 00:13:06,703
Hei, Will,

247
00:13:07,204 --> 00:13:09,122
aku butuh uang sewa itu.

248
00:13:26,390 --> 00:13:27,723
JUAL KEMBALI

249
00:13:27,724 --> 00:13:28,891
BESAR

250
00:13:28,892 --> 00:13:30,018
VINELAND RUMAH ROAR

251
00:13:33,605 --> 00:13:36,107
Lihat ini.

252
00:13:36,108 --> 00:13:39,402
Hijau Vineland, Fillmore Fours, asli.

253
00:13:39,403 --> 00:13:41,487
Jett memakainya di permainan Furball.

254
00:13:41,488 --> 00:13:43,739
Biasanya dijual sekitar $600,

255
00:13:43,740 --> 00:13:46,659
tetapi akan kujual kepadamu

256
00:13:46,660 --> 00:13:47,743
$500.

257
00:13:47,744 --> 00:13:50,330
Tidak, jangan Fours.

258
00:13:50,914 --> 00:13:52,290
Aku ingin itu.

259
00:13:52,291 --> 00:13:53,749
Namun, kau bokek.

260
00:13:53,750 --> 00:13:56,586
Andai punya Fours, aku tak terlihat bokek.

261
00:13:56,587 --> 00:13:59,255
Ya, itu benar. Semua akan baik-baik saja.

262
00:13:59,256 --> 00:14:02,176
Jaring atas mulus. Talinya masih kencang.

263
00:14:03,927 --> 00:14:05,845
- Gurih.
- Jijik.

264
00:14:05,846 --> 00:14:06,846
$250.

265
00:14:06,847 --> 00:14:08,931
- Yang benar.
- $250? Beraninya kau.

266
00:14:08,932 --> 00:14:10,641
Tidak sopan.

267
00:14:10,642 --> 00:14:13,019
Ayolah, Will. Aku bisa mencicilnya.

268
00:14:13,020 --> 00:14:16,148
Itu bagus, Daryl,
tetapi kosbasku tak terima cicilan.

269
00:14:16,773 --> 00:14:17,982
Baiklah.

270
00:14:17,983 --> 00:14:19,984
Aku tak sanggup melihatnya.

271
00:14:19,985 --> 00:14:22,070
Kalau $400?

272
00:14:22,613 --> 00:14:24,113
- $240
- Kenapa turun?

273
00:14:24,114 --> 00:14:26,699
- $230.
- Hentikan!

274
00:14:26,700 --> 00:14:29,619
- Kau tak akan percaya.
- Mustahil!

275
00:14:29,620 --> 00:14:33,874
Mane sedang di Cage
dan dia menerima penantang.

276
00:14:35,751 --> 00:14:40,005
Jadi, kita sepakat atau apa?

277
00:14:40,547 --> 00:14:41,381
Baiklah.

278
00:14:41,965 --> 00:14:43,008
Baiklah. Ayo.

279
00:14:55,479 --> 00:14:56,480
Siapa berikutnya?

280
00:15:00,108 --> 00:15:01,235
Lihat ini.

281
00:15:01,902 --> 00:15:03,028
Berikan itu.

282
00:15:05,155 --> 00:15:05,989
Sampah.

283
00:15:07,157 --> 00:15:10,159
Kataku, siapa berikutnya?

284
00:15:10,160 --> 00:15:12,621
Aku tak dengar apa pun. Kalian di mana?

285
00:15:13,455 --> 00:15:15,498
Siapa berikutnya?

286
00:15:15,499 --> 00:15:16,708
Hei. Oper bolanya.

287
00:15:17,584 --> 00:15:18,835
Ya!

288
00:15:18,836 --> 00:15:20,461
Kalahkan dia, Grizz!

289
00:15:20,462 --> 00:15:23,131
Ada sepotong sampah terbakar di sini.

290
00:15:24,550 --> 00:15:26,009
Sentuh aku.

291
00:15:35,143 --> 00:15:36,519
Ya!

292
00:15:36,520 --> 00:15:38,271
Enyah, Mane, kau pengacau.

293
00:15:38,272 --> 00:15:41,732
Serius?
Hanya ini kemampuan Vineland?

294
00:15:41,733 --> 00:15:44,403
Kukira Cage tempat roarball dilahirkan.

295
00:15:44,945 --> 00:15:49,657
Kurasa kota ini selemah pemain terbaiknya.

296
00:15:49,658 --> 00:15:51,325
Hei, di mana dia?

297
00:15:51,326 --> 00:15:56,080
Jika Jett tak muncul,
maka harus ada yang terima tantanganku.

298
00:15:56,081 --> 00:15:58,124
- Siapa berikutnya?
- Aku.

299
00:15:58,125 --> 00:15:59,417
Siapa itu?

300
00:15:59,418 --> 00:16:00,585
Hei!

301
00:16:00,586 --> 00:16:03,880
Tak ada yang boleh bicara
tentang Jett dan Vineland seperti itu.

302
00:16:03,881 --> 00:16:06,674
Permisi. Hei, minggir.

303
00:16:06,675 --> 00:16:07,676
Aku berikutnya.

304
00:16:08,552 --> 00:16:09,844
Berikan bolanya.

305
00:16:09,845 --> 00:16:11,471
Tunggu, seekor kambing?

306
00:16:14,391 --> 00:16:15,933
Terima kasih membuatku tertawa,

307
00:16:15,934 --> 00:16:19,312
tetapi lebih baik kau kembali
ke kolam renang anak-anak.

308
00:16:19,313 --> 00:16:20,521
Beli es krim saja.

309
00:16:20,522 --> 00:16:22,566
Serius, ada yang lain?

310
00:16:23,192 --> 00:16:24,775
Kalau aku taruhan?

311
00:16:24,776 --> 00:16:26,569
Pertama sepatu, kini uang sewamu?

312
00:16:26,570 --> 00:16:28,571
Bagus, Will. Komitmen.

313
00:16:28,572 --> 00:16:30,239
Bagaimana, Mane?

314
00:16:30,240 --> 00:16:32,033
Di mana omong besarmu, Mane?

315
00:16:32,034 --> 00:16:33,535
Ayo, Vineland!

316
00:16:34,161 --> 00:16:38,581
Jadi, hanya ini yang ditawarkan Vineland?

317
00:16:38,582 --> 00:16:41,084
Seekor kambing dan uang receh?

318
00:16:42,085 --> 00:16:43,294
Kalian tahu?

319
00:16:43,295 --> 00:16:46,088
Mane tak bersembunyi, berikan bolanya.

320
00:16:46,089 --> 00:16:47,341
Ayo kita lakukan.

321
00:16:48,342 --> 00:16:50,385
Semua dihitung satu poin.

322
00:16:50,886 --> 00:16:52,304
Pertama dapat tiga poin.

323
00:16:52,721 --> 00:16:53,639
Bolamu.

324
00:17:01,271 --> 00:17:02,188
Astaga!

325
00:17:02,189 --> 00:17:03,106
Itu satu.

326
00:17:03,732 --> 00:17:05,733
Andai kau hewan besar, sudah kuhajar.

327
00:17:08,237 --> 00:17:10,279
Kau tahu cara mengoper bola.

328
00:17:10,280 --> 00:17:12,199
Kau akan mengadangku dari jauh?

329
00:17:13,450 --> 00:17:14,742
Ayo.

330
00:17:15,285 --> 00:17:16,203
Ayo.

331
00:17:19,080 --> 00:17:21,083
Saat kudapat bolanya, berakhir sudah.

332
00:17:31,760 --> 00:17:33,637
Kau dipermalukan oleh kambing!

333
00:17:34,221 --> 00:17:36,180
- Astaga!
- Hei!

334
00:17:36,181 --> 00:17:37,474
Kambing ini hebat!

335
00:17:39,852 --> 00:17:41,937
Dia dipermalukan!

336
00:17:48,277 --> 00:17:50,319
Baiklah. Waktunya serius.

337
00:17:50,320 --> 00:17:53,114
Kau membuatku melepaskan kalung.

338
00:17:53,115 --> 00:17:55,158
Ya. Lepaskan semuanya.

339
00:17:56,910 --> 00:17:58,202
Baiklah. Aku paham.

340
00:17:58,203 --> 00:18:00,455
Kau mahir melempar dari jauh, bukan?

341
00:18:01,248 --> 00:18:02,416
Coba lewati aku.

342
00:18:06,587 --> 00:18:08,004
Kita main sungguhan.

343
00:18:08,005 --> 00:18:09,673
Ini rasanya bermain di liga.

344
00:18:10,174 --> 00:18:11,258
Ini wilayahku.

345
00:18:16,638 --> 00:18:18,098
Kau milikku sekarang.

346
00:18:38,911 --> 00:18:40,621
Aku tak membantumu berdiri.

347
00:18:41,538 --> 00:18:43,248
Aku ingin uangnya.

348
00:18:43,874 --> 00:18:45,209
Terima kasih.

349
00:18:47,044 --> 00:18:50,296
Hei! Ada uang kambing.

350
00:18:50,297 --> 00:18:51,464
Itu lumayan.

351
00:18:51,465 --> 00:18:54,759
Mereka tidak merekamnya selama itu.

352
00:18:54,760 --> 00:18:55,927
Benar, Daryl?

353
00:18:55,928 --> 00:18:57,888
Ya, mereka merekamnya.

354
00:19:14,279 --> 00:19:15,614
Ayo.

355
00:19:25,832 --> 00:19:26,834
Apa?

356
00:19:27,960 --> 00:19:29,711
MAAF NAK

357
00:19:30,420 --> 00:19:31,629
Aku mengerti.

358
00:19:31,630 --> 00:19:35,967
Hei, Will. Aku minta maaf soal ayahku.

359
00:19:35,968 --> 00:19:39,680
Namun, ketahuilah
bahwa aku percaya kepadamu.

360
00:19:41,014 --> 00:19:43,141
Kubuatkan roti lapis. Tangkap!

361
00:19:47,479 --> 00:19:49,522
Aduh. Meleset.

362
00:19:49,523 --> 00:19:50,524
Maaf soal itu.

363
00:19:52,442 --> 00:19:53,776
Jangan khawatir.

364
00:19:53,777 --> 00:19:57,029
Aku akan menontonmu di Greenhouse
saat kau bermain untuk Thorns!

365
00:19:57,030 --> 00:19:58,824
- Terima kasih, Theo.
- Semoga berhasil!

366
00:20:00,909 --> 00:20:06,205
- Sudah kukatakan videonya dahsyat.
- Ya, dia cepat.

367
00:20:06,206 --> 00:20:09,000
- Hei! Apa kabar, Kawan?
- Hei.

368
00:20:09,001 --> 00:20:10,293
- Hei.
- Itu dia.

369
00:20:10,294 --> 00:20:13,087
Terima kasih aku boleh tidur di sini.

370
00:20:13,088 --> 00:20:15,798
Kau bawa barang?
Lempar saja ke tumpukan itu.

371
00:20:15,799 --> 00:20:17,133
Masih belum beres.

372
00:20:17,134 --> 00:20:19,177
Pilih satu tumpukan. Semua kotor.

373
00:20:19,178 --> 00:20:22,389
Berhenti bicara dan lihat yang kukerjakan.

374
00:20:36,445 --> 00:20:37,613
SAMPAH

375
00:20:37,946 --> 00:20:39,071
WILL MENANG!

376
00:20:39,072 --> 00:20:40,489
Kau suka?

377
00:20:40,490 --> 00:20:42,617
Ayolah, ini akan viral.

378
00:20:42,618 --> 00:20:44,160
Kau buat kakinya terkilir.

379
00:20:44,161 --> 00:20:45,704
Ya, dan dia merusak tandukku.

380
00:20:46,205 --> 00:20:49,999
Will, kau ingin rekaman
melawan pemain besar.

381
00:20:50,000 --> 00:20:53,628
Kau menghadapi
pemain terbesar dalam roarball.

382
00:20:53,629 --> 00:20:55,714
- Benar.
- Kau melakukannya, Will.

383
00:20:56,548 --> 00:20:58,382
Baiklah.

384
00:20:58,383 --> 00:21:02,553
Langsung saja aku unggah
karena Daryl buang gas.

385
00:21:02,554 --> 00:21:03,763
Sampai jumpa.

386
00:21:03,764 --> 00:21:05,890
Aku ada kencan. Harus bercukur.

387
00:21:05,891 --> 00:21:07,225
Dengan siapa?

388
00:21:07,226 --> 00:21:09,019
Aku belum beri tahu? Ibumu.

389
00:21:09,770 --> 00:21:11,270
Ya ampun.

390
00:21:11,271 --> 00:21:12,438
Dia menang, Kawan.

391
00:21:12,439 --> 00:21:15,233
Baiklah. Itu bahkan tidak lucu.

392
00:21:15,234 --> 00:21:18,486
Hei, Bung. Ingin bermain Roar 2K?

393
00:21:18,487 --> 00:21:19,820
Tidak.

394
00:21:19,821 --> 00:21:21,072
Aku mau tidur.

395
00:21:21,073 --> 00:21:23,033
Tentu saja. Buat dirimu nyaman.

396
00:21:23,575 --> 00:21:25,160
Aku mau main gim.

397
00:21:29,957 --> 00:21:30,958
Halo!

398
00:21:33,293 --> 00:21:34,545
Baiklah.

399
00:21:59,778 --> 00:22:01,029
Lihat, itu dia.

400
00:22:01,697 --> 00:22:03,782
Itu benar-benar dia!

401
00:22:06,910 --> 00:22:08,579
Hei! Apa kabar, Sobat?

402
00:22:09,913 --> 00:22:10,997
Hei, Will.

403
00:22:10,998 --> 00:22:13,332
- Hei, Will.
- Hai, hewan asing.

404
00:22:13,333 --> 00:22:15,126
Lihat, Bu. Itu Will.

405
00:22:15,127 --> 00:22:17,588
- Maafkan aku.
- Tak apa-apa.

406
00:22:22,759 --> 00:22:26,555
Siapa hewan bodoh
yang parkir begitu di luar?

407
00:22:27,806 --> 00:22:28,932
Semua baik-baik saja?

408
00:22:30,976 --> 00:22:32,226
Kenapa tak berkedip?

409
00:22:32,227 --> 00:22:35,271
Itu aku, Sayang. Aku si bodoh.

410
00:22:35,272 --> 00:22:38,566
Kau Florence Everson! Pemilik Thorns!

411
00:22:38,567 --> 00:22:41,986
Kau bisa abaikan
semua pesan suara, Tn. Harris.

412
00:22:41,987 --> 00:22:44,405
Aku telah menemukanmu sendiri.

413
00:22:44,406 --> 00:22:46,240
Dia sudah menunggumu.

414
00:22:46,241 --> 00:22:48,160
Tanpa pesan apa pun.

415
00:22:48,660 --> 00:22:49,785
Duduk.

416
00:22:49,786 --> 00:22:52,413
Pertandingan kemarin hebat sekali.

417
00:22:52,414 --> 00:22:56,167
Kau patahkan pergelangan kaki Mane,
kukira dia harus pensiun!

418
00:22:56,168 --> 00:22:59,129
Internet menyukainya.

419
00:22:59,713 --> 00:23:01,881
Mereka menyukaimu.

420
00:23:01,882 --> 00:23:04,092
Itu hebat!

421
00:23:04,635 --> 00:23:06,010
Ini makin hebat.

422
00:23:06,011 --> 00:23:09,514
Will, mungkin kau tak tahu,
tetapi tim kita buruk.

423
00:23:09,515 --> 00:23:10,598
Kita payah.

424
00:23:10,599 --> 00:23:15,561
Kita punya pemain terbaik di liga
tetapi tidak menang Claw, lagi...

425
00:23:15,562 --> 00:23:17,063
Sesama hewan kecil,

426
00:23:17,064 --> 00:23:22,985
aku percaya kaulah yang dibutuhkan
oleh Jett dan tim ini.

427
00:23:22,986 --> 00:23:28,533
Kambing, tentu. Namun, menurutku
kau adalah unicorn bertanduk dua.

428
00:23:28,534 --> 00:23:30,243
- Benarkah?
- Ya.

429
00:23:30,244 --> 00:23:33,080
Aku ingin memberimu penawaran.

430
00:23:33,580 --> 00:23:37,793
Kami butuh pemain keenam Thorns
untuk sisa musim ini.

431
00:23:38,502 --> 00:23:42,088
Astaga. Apakah...
Akhirnya ini sungguh terjadi?

432
00:23:42,089 --> 00:23:44,715
Tanda tangan di sini,
beberapa inisial di sini,

433
00:23:44,716 --> 00:23:46,551
dan kau resmi anggota Thorns.

434
00:23:46,552 --> 00:23:48,886
Jett. Dia menyetujui ini?

435
00:23:48,887 --> 00:23:51,264
Dalam banyak hal, ini idenya.

436
00:23:51,265 --> 00:23:52,181
DOKUMEN KESEPAKATAN

437
00:23:52,182 --> 00:23:53,349
Jadi, bagaimana?

438
00:23:53,350 --> 00:23:57,478
Bermain untuk Vineland,
atau tetap di sini membereskan mejaku?

439
00:23:57,479 --> 00:24:00,189
Pena! Tolong beri aku pena!

440
00:24:00,190 --> 00:24:01,358
Aku tak punya...

441
00:24:02,150 --> 00:24:03,277
Terima kasih.

442
00:24:04,903 --> 00:24:07,196
W. H.

443
00:24:07,197 --> 00:24:09,866
Di mana ada Will, pasti ada jalan.

444
00:24:09,867 --> 00:24:14,370
Selamat, Sayang. Kami bangga kepadamu.

445
00:24:14,371 --> 00:24:16,623
Will!

446
00:24:18,208 --> 00:24:19,542
Aku tak percaya!

447
00:24:19,543 --> 00:24:21,752
Aku akan menjadi Vineland Thorn!

448
00:24:21,753 --> 00:24:24,630
- Berita baru! Will, ini viral!
- Kau tak akan percaya!

449
00:24:24,631 --> 00:24:25,798
Memang.

450
00:24:25,799 --> 00:24:27,466
Aku senang, Will.

451
00:24:27,467 --> 00:24:29,011
Siapa hewan berkelas itu?

452
00:24:29,803 --> 00:24:31,889
Aku benci kota ini.

453
00:24:33,640 --> 00:24:35,058
ALARM PAGI

454
00:24:51,575 --> 00:24:53,535
Sakit.

455
00:24:59,166 --> 00:25:01,167
<i>Selamat datang di Roar Roundup.</i>

456
00:25:01,168 --> 00:25:03,169
<i>Aku dua kali juara, Chuck,</i>

457
00:25:03,170 --> 00:25:06,172
<i>bersama rekan pembawa acaraku,
si kecil menggemaskan,</i>

458
00:25:06,173 --> 00:25:07,590
<i>- Rusty.
- Rusty!</i>

459
00:25:07,591 --> 00:25:10,427
<i>Aku tak sabar menunggumu pensiun, Chuck.</i>

460
00:25:10,928 --> 00:25:14,597
<i>Itu lucu. Kembali ke pertanyaan
yang kita ajukan tiap musim.</i>

461
00:25:14,598 --> 00:25:17,016
<i>Apa bisa jadi pemain terbaik
tanpa menang kejuaraan?</i>

462
00:25:17,017 --> 00:25:19,519
- Ya. Apa ini?
<i>- Jujur saja, Claw membangun karier.</i>

463
00:25:19,520 --> 00:25:20,728
<i>- Sudah jelas!</i>
- Tidak.

464
00:25:20,729 --> 00:25:22,897
<i>Kasihan Fillmore. Dia pemain hebat,</i>

465
00:25:22,898 --> 00:25:25,107
<i>tetapi tak ada yang kebal melawan waktu.</i>

466
00:25:25,108 --> 00:25:27,527
Tanpaku, tak ada yang bisa
mereka bicarakan.

467
00:25:27,528 --> 00:25:29,237
<i>Statistik bagus, tanpa Claw.</i>

468
00:25:29,238 --> 00:25:30,988
<i>Namun, kau tak bisa salahkan dia.</i>

469
00:25:30,989 --> 00:25:34,408
<i>Bagi yang menonton tim ini dan berkata
Jett masalahnya adalah sebuta...</i>

470
00:25:34,409 --> 00:25:37,870
<i>Sebuta apa, Chuck? Katakan.</i>

471
00:25:37,871 --> 00:25:41,582
Aku pencetak skor terbanyak
sepanjang sejarah Roar.

472
00:25:41,583 --> 00:25:43,751
<i>Bicara soal Thorns,
ada berita baru, Chuck!</i>

473
00:25:43,752 --> 00:25:45,002
THORNS REKRUT PEMAIN BARU

474
00:25:45,003 --> 00:25:47,004
<i>Akhirnya Vineland Thorns
merekrut pemain keenam.</i>

475
00:25:47,005 --> 00:25:48,881
<i>Akhirnya Jett dapat bantuan.</i>

476
00:25:48,882 --> 00:25:50,174
Ya! Buaya?

477
00:25:50,175 --> 00:25:52,176
Tidak. Lebih besar. Gorila?

478
00:25:52,177 --> 00:25:54,136
<i>- Kita beralih ke Florence Everson...</i>
- Itu yang kusuka.

479
00:25:54,137 --> 00:25:55,555
<i>...dengan wawancara khusus.</i>

480
00:25:55,556 --> 00:25:58,349
<i>Kami rekrut pemain roarball kecil pertama.</i>

481
00:25:58,350 --> 00:25:59,851
Kecil apa?

482
00:25:59,852 --> 00:26:01,561
<i>Pemain ini pendek...</i>

483
00:26:01,562 --> 00:26:02,603
Pendek apa?

484
00:26:02,604 --> 00:26:04,355
<i>- ...mini...</i>
- Apa katamu?

485
00:26:04,356 --> 00:26:05,815
<i>- ...kecil...</i>
- Boleh ulang?

486
00:26:05,816 --> 00:26:07,859
<i>...dan dia adalah kambing.</i>

487
00:26:07,860 --> 00:26:09,403
Kambing?

488
00:26:25,961 --> 00:26:27,336
Jangan lagi.

489
00:26:27,337 --> 00:26:29,255
Florence Marjorie Everson!

490
00:26:29,256 --> 00:26:33,134
Kau merekrut kambing? Kau sudah gila?

491
00:26:33,135 --> 00:26:35,428
Baiklah. Maaf.

492
00:26:35,429 --> 00:26:38,514
Kau minta pemain
yang bisa memenangkan Claw

493
00:26:38,515 --> 00:26:41,142
dan kau tak peduli caranya. Ingat?

494
00:26:41,143 --> 00:26:43,311
Aku peduli tentang ini.

495
00:26:43,312 --> 00:26:45,104
Aku tak bisa bermain dengan kambing.

496
00:26:45,105 --> 00:26:47,064
Dia memalukan untuk tim.

497
00:26:47,065 --> 00:26:49,233
Dia memalukan bagi kota. Dia...

498
00:26:49,234 --> 00:26:50,652
Dia duduk di situ.

499
00:26:52,112 --> 00:26:53,739
Hei!

500
00:26:55,490 --> 00:26:57,033
Kau pasti bercanda.

501
00:26:57,034 --> 00:26:59,160
Aku bahkan tak melihatnya duduk, Flo.

502
00:26:59,161 --> 00:27:00,745
Bagaimana nanti di lapangan?

503
00:27:00,746 --> 00:27:03,080
Aku kambing
yang mengenakan jersei Thorns.

504
00:27:03,081 --> 00:27:04,165
Paham maksudku?

505
00:27:04,166 --> 00:27:05,167
Ya.

506
00:27:05,667 --> 00:27:07,377
Jangan lihat, Flo. Biar kumakan dia.

507
00:27:07,503 --> 00:27:10,588
Kumakan dengan saus salad,

508
00:27:10,589 --> 00:27:13,216
dan kita akan berpura-pura
ini tak pernah terjadi.

509
00:27:13,217 --> 00:27:14,717
Rasaku tak enak.

510
00:27:14,718 --> 00:27:16,135
Katamu dia sudah tahu.

511
00:27:16,136 --> 00:27:18,472
Sudah tugasku untuk bermulut manis, Will.

512
00:27:19,515 --> 00:27:23,100
Juga, merencanakan keberhasilan
jangka panjang.

513
00:27:23,101 --> 00:27:26,687
Ini lebih menarik perhatian
dari tahun-tahun sebelumnya.

514
00:27:26,688 --> 00:27:29,023
Terserah kalau kau tak mau main dengannya.

515
00:27:29,024 --> 00:27:31,443
Namun, dia tetap jadi anggota.

516
00:27:32,110 --> 00:27:34,153
Kau pasti sudah kehilangan akal.

517
00:27:34,154 --> 00:27:35,989
Turunkan cakarmu.

518
00:27:36,823 --> 00:27:38,699
Kau seharusnya senang.

519
00:27:38,700 --> 00:27:43,663
Semua berjalan sempurna
karena media ingin bertemu Will.

520
00:27:43,664 --> 00:27:45,456
Will, turun.

521
00:27:45,457 --> 00:27:47,834
- Baiklah.
- Aku ingin kau perkenalkan dia.

522
00:27:47,835 --> 00:27:49,961
- Tidak akan.
- Ya, kau harus.

523
00:27:49,962 --> 00:27:52,630
Mereka menunggumu di bawah.

524
00:27:52,631 --> 00:27:54,924
Jadi, tegakkan ekormu.

525
00:27:54,925 --> 00:27:58,011
Senyumlah! Aku cinta kalian!
Sekarang pergilah!

526
00:28:00,931 --> 00:28:02,557
Jett, hei.

527
00:28:02,558 --> 00:28:05,935
Ketahuilah bahwa ini impianku
yang menjadi kenyataan.

528
00:28:05,936 --> 00:28:09,064
Bermain bersamamu,
pemain favoritku sepanjang masa.

529
00:28:09,606 --> 00:28:11,440
Aku memang tak sesuai harapanmu,

530
00:28:11,441 --> 00:28:14,360
tetapi sudah lama aku berlatih untuk ini.

531
00:28:14,361 --> 00:28:16,028
Jika kau memberiku...

532
00:28:16,029 --> 00:28:19,615
Dengarkan, Nak. Aku melihat video viralmu.

533
00:28:19,616 --> 00:28:21,784
Mane membuatmu terlihat seperti pecundang.

534
00:28:21,785 --> 00:28:25,204
Ya. Aku akan senang
melihatmu dipermalukan.

535
00:28:25,205 --> 00:28:28,916
- Jett! Sebelah sini!
- Hei, Jett!

536
00:28:28,917 --> 00:28:31,836
- Will!
- Will, sebelah sini!

537
00:28:31,837 --> 00:28:34,214
- Will, sebelah sini!
- Will.

538
00:28:50,981 --> 00:28:53,024
Mari kita mulai.
Pertanyaan sulit dahulu.

539
00:28:53,025 --> 00:28:55,067
Viral di lapangan memberimu hak

540
00:28:55,068 --> 00:28:56,360
main roarball profesional?

541
00:28:56,361 --> 00:28:57,612
Takut mengecewakan?

542
00:28:57,613 --> 00:28:59,238
Apa ini cara humas

543
00:28:59,239 --> 00:29:01,157
agar semua lupa kekalahan Thorns?

544
00:29:01,158 --> 00:29:02,241
Kau benar kambing?

545
00:29:02,242 --> 00:29:03,868
- Bukankah kau payah?
- Aku...

546
00:29:03,869 --> 00:29:05,953
Maaf. Boleh ulang pertanyaannya?

547
00:29:05,954 --> 00:29:08,456
Hei. Satu per satu.

548
00:29:08,457 --> 00:29:11,042
Anak ini belum dilatih menghadapi media.

549
00:29:11,043 --> 00:29:13,336
Will, apa rasanya
menjadi hewan kecil pertama

550
00:29:13,337 --> 00:29:15,047
menjadi pemain roarball profesional?

551
00:29:15,672 --> 00:29:18,758
Jujur saja, semua ini sulit dipercaya.

552
00:29:18,759 --> 00:29:21,886
Tadi malam aku mengusir kecoak
di rumah sahabatku,

553
00:29:21,887 --> 00:29:24,389
dan kini aku bermain untuk Thorns.

554
00:29:24,932 --> 00:29:26,349
Seharusnya kau tak berkata itu.

555
00:29:26,350 --> 00:29:28,559
Will, komunitas kecoak tersinggung

556
00:29:28,560 --> 00:29:29,644
atas komentarmu.

557
00:29:29,645 --> 00:29:31,020
Kau ingin minta maaf?

558
00:29:31,021 --> 00:29:33,272
Ya ampun. Bukan itu maksudku.

559
00:29:33,273 --> 00:29:35,566
- Aku suka kecoak.
- Bohong.

560
00:29:35,567 --> 00:29:37,568
- Pertanyaan berikut?
- Aku.

561
00:29:37,569 --> 00:29:40,196
Will, kau tidak takut terluka?

562
00:29:40,197 --> 00:29:42,281
Pemain besar pun terluka dalam Roarball.

563
00:29:42,282 --> 00:29:45,118
Kubayangkan untuk hewan kecil bisa fatal.

564
00:29:45,661 --> 00:29:48,287
- Itu...
- Will sudah tahu risikonya.

565
00:29:48,288 --> 00:29:50,665
Apa dia akan diserang? Bisa saja.

566
00:29:50,666 --> 00:29:52,291
Babak belur? Mungkin.

567
00:29:52,292 --> 00:29:54,252
Tewas? Kemungkinan besar.

568
00:29:54,253 --> 00:29:56,754
Namun, sebesar itulah cintanya
pada permainan ini.

569
00:29:56,755 --> 00:29:58,382
Dia rela mati untuk ini.

570
00:29:59,007 --> 00:30:01,384
- Benar, Will?
- Benar.

571
00:30:01,385 --> 00:30:02,552
Kalau Mane?

572
00:30:02,553 --> 00:30:04,428
Kau takut tanding ulang dengannya?

573
00:30:04,429 --> 00:30:05,513
Tentu tidak.

574
00:30:05,514 --> 00:30:09,809
Kami menyebutnya pawang kuda
karena dia berhasil menjinakkannya.

575
00:30:09,810 --> 00:30:11,435
Tahu apa katanya tadi?

576
00:30:11,436 --> 00:30:13,062
Dia punya julukan untuk Mane.

577
00:30:13,063 --> 00:30:15,399
Dia menyebutnya "My Little Pony."

578
00:30:15,941 --> 00:30:17,525
- Benar?
- Aku tak bilang itu.

579
00:30:17,526 --> 00:30:18,776
- Ya.
- Aku tak bilang itu.

580
00:30:18,777 --> 00:30:22,281
Dia juga berkata Mane
bukan pemain terbaik,

581
00:30:22,781 --> 00:30:25,199
<i>rambutnya juga jelek, dan aku setuju.</i>

582
00:30:25,200 --> 00:30:26,409
Awas dia.

583
00:30:26,410 --> 00:30:27,995
- Kenapa kau begini?
- Terakhir.

584
00:30:28,495 --> 00:30:30,204
Untuk Jett. Ini tahun kelimabelasmu.

585
00:30:30,205 --> 00:30:32,331
Tim merekrut kambing
untuk selesaikan masalah.

586
00:30:32,332 --> 00:30:34,625
Apa mungkin sudah saatnya kau pensiun?

587
00:30:34,626 --> 00:30:36,919
Aku tidak pensiun.

588
00:30:36,920 --> 00:30:39,881
Aku merasa bugar, bermain sangat baik.

589
00:30:39,882 --> 00:30:43,050
Aku sudah bermain
dengan semua pecundang di liga ini.

590
00:30:43,051 --> 00:30:48,890
Aku hanya khawatir saat aku
melakukan apa pun untuk memenangkan Claw,

591
00:30:48,891 --> 00:30:52,560
dan tak ada yang bisa menghalangiku.

592
00:30:52,561 --> 00:30:54,687
Terima kasih. Bagel di lantai tiga.

593
00:30:54,688 --> 00:30:55,813
Jett, sebelah sini!

594
00:30:55,814 --> 00:30:57,607
Ya. Baiklah.

595
00:30:57,608 --> 00:30:59,775
- Will!
- Kau ada komentar?

596
00:30:59,776 --> 00:31:01,778
Aku bisa... Terima kasih.

597
00:31:02,279 --> 00:31:03,530
Dah.

598
00:31:05,282 --> 00:31:09,160
Pelatih Dennis, apa rencanamu
dengan kambing itu dalam rotasi?

599
00:31:09,161 --> 00:31:11,579
Itu pertanyaan bagus. Itu...

600
00:31:11,580 --> 00:31:13,664
Dennis, kuserahkan dia kepadamu.

601
00:31:13,665 --> 00:31:15,124
Jett, ada waktu?

602
00:31:15,125 --> 00:31:17,794
Aku ingin menjelaskan strategi baru.

603
00:31:18,921 --> 00:31:20,756
Kau mendengarku. Kita lakukan nanti.

604
00:31:21,798 --> 00:31:24,218
Apa kabar, Nak?
Dennis Cooper. Senang berkenalan.

605
00:31:24,968 --> 00:31:27,720
Aku mengenalmu, Pelatih Dennis.
Suatu kehormatan.

606
00:31:27,721 --> 00:31:29,597
Pelatih terlalu berlebihan.

607
00:31:29,598 --> 00:31:32,851
Aku hanya pembawa papan klip
dengan upah kecil.

608
00:31:33,769 --> 00:31:35,228
Namun, aku terus berusaha.

609
00:31:35,229 --> 00:31:36,812
Ayo pakai seragammu.

610
00:31:36,813 --> 00:31:37,813
Aku siap bermain.

611
00:31:37,814 --> 00:31:40,358
Bermain? Lucu sekali. Tidak.

612
00:31:40,359 --> 00:31:41,443
- Apa?
- Tak ada apa-apa.

613
00:31:42,110 --> 00:31:43,820
Ini tempatnya.

614
00:31:45,447 --> 00:31:48,408
Hebat. Ruang ganti Thorns?

615
00:31:49,952 --> 00:31:51,327
Ya!

616
00:31:51,328 --> 00:31:53,789
Ganti baju dan perkenalkan tim.

617
00:31:54,540 --> 00:31:56,749
Ya!

618
00:31:56,750 --> 00:31:58,168
Ini gila sekali!

619
00:32:01,380 --> 00:32:06,426
Namaku. Di jersei Thorns.

620
00:32:08,053 --> 00:32:11,014
Tunggu. Fillmore 13?

621
00:32:21,733 --> 00:32:22,860
Lumayan.

622
00:32:25,863 --> 00:32:26,905
Benar?

623
00:32:30,409 --> 00:32:31,742
<i>Ini malam pertandingan.</i>

624
00:32:31,743 --> 00:32:32,660
BERSIAPLAH

625
00:32:32,661 --> 00:32:35,746
<i>Selamat datang
di Roarball Hewan Regional.</i>

626
00:32:35,747 --> 00:32:38,374
<i>Olahraga dengan lapangan terliar.</i>

627
00:32:38,375 --> 00:32:39,667
<i>Stalaktit.</i>

628
00:32:39,668 --> 00:32:40,960
<i>Badai pasir.</i>

629
00:32:40,961 --> 00:32:41,878
<i>Tebing.</i>

630
00:32:41,879 --> 00:32:42,837
<i>Es.</i>

631
00:32:42,838 --> 00:32:44,630
<i>Api dan tanaman merambat!</i>

632
00:32:44,631 --> 00:32:46,549
<i>Malam ini, kita berada di Greenhouse,</i>

633
00:32:46,550 --> 00:32:48,467
<i>dan stadion bersorak...</i>

634
00:32:48,468 --> 00:32:50,469
<i>...untuk pertandingan pertama dari tiga.</i>

635
00:32:50,470 --> 00:32:55,184
<i>Tak mengejutkan, banyak hewan kecil hadir
untuk pemain baru Thorn dari Vineland.</i>

636
00:32:59,688 --> 00:33:02,107
<i>Kamera Cium sedang berkeliling!</i>

637
00:33:02,858 --> 00:33:04,859
<i>Sepertinya ada yang jatuh cinta!</i>

638
00:33:04,860 --> 00:33:06,652
<i>Mereka terlihat mesra!</i>

639
00:33:06,653 --> 00:33:09,323
<i>"Polly mau biskuit?" Benar, muntahan?</i>

640
00:33:14,912 --> 00:33:15,913
Kau menangkapnya!

641
00:33:17,164 --> 00:33:18,582
Aku genius.

642
00:33:19,166 --> 00:33:21,834
Baiklah, Olivia. Tenangkan dirimu.

643
00:33:21,835 --> 00:33:23,252
Aku memegang kendali.

644
00:33:23,253 --> 00:33:25,922
Aku tahu siapa diriku. Aku cukup baik.

645
00:33:25,923 --> 00:33:28,299
Aku tak peduli pendapat hewan lain.

646
00:33:28,300 --> 00:33:31,135
Aku tak peduli
apa kata internet tentang diriku,

647
00:33:31,136 --> 00:33:33,513
di berbagai platform yang bisa kuperiksa,

648
00:33:33,514 --> 00:33:34,889
untuk lihat pendapat mereka.

649
00:33:34,890 --> 00:33:37,558
Ponsel! Ada yang punya ponsel?

650
00:33:37,559 --> 00:33:39,018
Kau bahkan tak pakai seragam!

651
00:33:39,019 --> 00:33:41,062
Ini bisa disobek.

652
00:33:41,063 --> 00:33:43,232
- Lenny.
- Ayah kena!

653
00:33:44,107 --> 00:33:45,650
Ayah adalah yeti!

654
00:33:45,651 --> 00:33:50,488
Dengarkan. Ayah senang
kalian kreatif dengan busa,

655
00:33:50,489 --> 00:33:54,952
tetapi tak baik menembak wajah Ayah.

656
00:33:56,078 --> 00:33:57,245
Anak-anak yang lucu.

657
00:33:57,246 --> 00:33:58,663
Aku tahu.

658
00:33:58,664 --> 00:34:01,749
Jangan lihat, tetapi ada anak kambing
berjalan ke arah kita

659
00:34:01,750 --> 00:34:04,210
dengan senyuman aneh di wajah.

660
00:34:04,211 --> 00:34:05,795
Aku Will Harris.

661
00:34:05,796 --> 00:34:09,216
Siap membantu tim menang sebisa mungkin.

662
00:34:09,800 --> 00:34:12,968
Camilan sebelum pertandingan.

663
00:34:12,969 --> 00:34:15,721
Biar kubuka rahangku lebar-lebar.

664
00:34:15,722 --> 00:34:17,640
Tidak! Jangan makan aku!

665
00:34:17,641 --> 00:34:20,017
- Ini anak yang mewabah!
- Dia sakit?

666
00:34:20,018 --> 00:34:22,061
Bukan, dia menjadi viral.

667
00:34:22,062 --> 00:34:26,566
Aneh. Aku suka. Ayo menari.

668
00:34:26,567 --> 00:34:29,276
Kami tak melakukan tarian anehmu, Modo.

669
00:34:29,277 --> 00:34:30,862
Aku menyukainya.

670
00:34:34,574 --> 00:34:37,202
Untuk apa telur itu?

671
00:34:39,161 --> 00:34:41,748
Jangan biarkan mereka mengendalikanmu.

672
00:34:43,792 --> 00:34:45,585
Berakar kuat.

673
00:34:46,043 --> 00:34:49,421
Berakar kuat.

674
00:34:49,422 --> 00:34:51,675
Di sini ramai sekali, bukan?

675
00:34:52,176 --> 00:34:55,512
Jett? Apa aku akan dapat kesempatan
bermain malam ini?

676
00:34:56,972 --> 00:35:00,475
<i>Perkenalkan pemain Thorn barumu.</i>

677
00:35:01,185 --> 00:35:05,229
<i>Pemain dengan tinggi memukau 1,7 meter,</i>

678
00:35:05,230 --> 00:35:07,023
<i>dari Vineland Selatan,</i>

679
00:35:07,024 --> 00:35:13,822
<i>hewan yang menghadapi Mane, Will Harris!</i>

680
00:35:17,201 --> 00:35:18,492
Di mana dia? Aku tak bisa lihat.

681
00:35:18,493 --> 00:35:20,453
Akankah sejarah tercipta malam ini,

682
00:35:20,454 --> 00:35:23,456
atau dia akan mengikuti jejakmu
yang mengecewakan, Chuck?

683
00:35:23,457 --> 00:35:25,917
Kau payah, Rusty.
Ya, itu lelucon kelalawar.

684
00:35:25,918 --> 00:35:27,877
- Ya! Ayo, Will!
- Ya, Will!

685
00:35:27,878 --> 00:35:30,505
Itu Will, bukan? Dia seperti gerbil.

686
00:35:30,506 --> 00:35:32,340
Menurutmu Will akan main?

687
00:35:32,341 --> 00:35:34,926
Semoga tidak,
atau kita akan melihatnya babak belur.

688
00:35:34,927 --> 00:35:35,844
Gerald!

689
00:35:41,725 --> 00:35:44,727
- Ya! Itu dia!
- Ayo! Semangat!

690
00:35:44,728 --> 00:35:46,562
Pelatih, kapan aku bermain?

691
00:35:46,563 --> 00:35:50,816
- Pelajari saja strateginya, Nak.
- Habisi dia!

692
00:35:50,817 --> 00:35:51,776
Waktunya bercerita?

693
00:35:51,777 --> 00:35:55,821
Ya. Mendekatlah. Dahulu,
ada strategi yang disebut Elang 24.

694
00:35:55,822 --> 00:35:57,490
Aku suka ini.

695
00:35:57,491 --> 00:35:59,909
Ada yang lelah? Aku bisa gantikan.

696
00:35:59,910 --> 00:36:01,119
- Aku mau istirahat.
- Tidak.

697
00:36:01,870 --> 00:36:04,873
Dia akan main
di pertandingan berikut. Percayalah.

698
00:36:06,208 --> 00:36:07,416
Kita butuh poin.

699
00:36:07,417 --> 00:36:10,294
Modo, tetap di perimeter. Jaga jarak.

700
00:36:10,295 --> 00:36:12,046
Tunjukkan kemampuanmu.

701
00:36:12,047 --> 00:36:14,758
Aku selalu menunjukkannya.

702
00:36:15,676 --> 00:36:19,638
Bola!

703
00:36:20,848 --> 00:36:24,225
Kuperhatikan rusa besar itu
cenderung ke kanan,

704
00:36:24,226 --> 00:36:27,311
jadi, jika kau geser pertahanan...

705
00:36:27,312 --> 00:36:29,772
Siapa mau istirahat di bawah daun akasia?

706
00:36:29,773 --> 00:36:30,899
